Good evening, Ms. Vencore.

00:25:41.240 --> 00:25:43.620
I'm Jerry Moore, Maurice Minifield's broker.

00:25:44.590 --> 00:25:44.890
May I?

00:25:45.730 --> 00:25:46.370
Oh, sure.

00:25:47.400 --> 00:25:49.070
Hi, Jerry Moore.

00:25:49.720 --> 00:25:51.280
Maurice had me up for a little year-end planning.

00:25:51.540 --> 00:25:52.440
I thought I'd stop by.

00:25:52.760 --> 00:25:53.340
Pleased to meet you.

00:25:54.010 --> 00:25:55.250
Oh, that must be Miranda.

00:25:55.770 --> 00:25:56.510
Certainly is.

00:25:56.690 --> 00:25:58.470
She's a very lucky little girl.

00:25:59.060 --> 00:25:59.980
Maurice has started a...

00:26:00.000 --> 00:26:05.470
growth portfolio for these are all stocks that he owns and has done very well with what do you

00:26:05.470 --> 00:26:13.500
mean here's a statement of the stocks that Miranda owns the accounts in her name with Maurice as

00:26:13.500 --> 00:26:19.190
custodian since she's still a minor let me get this straight now these are stocks that Maurice

00:26:19.190 --> 00:26:26.740
bought from my daughter that's right $10,000 worth here's my card call me if you have any

00:26:26.740 --> 00:26:28.970
questions I'm in the office by 6 every morning

00:26:30.570 --> 00:26:54.820
thanks hi dr capra what can i get you dr capra you know eugene there was this little juice bar

00:26:54.820 --> 00:26:59.980
in the mini mall next to my office in santa monica and every after

00:27:00.580 --> 00:27:06.280
I'd run down there between patients and I would treat myself to a fresh mango apricot shake.

00:27:08.110 --> 00:27:08.610
Sounds good.

00:27:10.460 --> 00:27:13.950
That's what I'd like, Eugene. A fresh mango apricot shake.

00:27:14.960 --> 00:27:18.260
Sorry, Dr. Capra. No mangoes, no apricots.

00:27:19.980 --> 00:27:22.280
Well, this is a restaurant, isn't it? You must have fresh fruit.

00:27:23.720 --> 00:27:25.140
Just apples. Pippin's.

00:27:26.220 --> 00:27:28.640
Why don't you check in the kitchen? Maybe you missed the mangoes.

00:27:29.280 --> 00:27:29.540
No.

00:27:30.670 --> 00:27:32.190
I just did the produce run for this week.

00:27:33.120 --> 00:27:35.090
No mangoes, no apricots.

00:27:35.310 --> 00:27:41.760
Know something, Eugene?

00:27:42.960 --> 00:27:43.680
Yeah, Dr. Capra?

00:27:45.620 --> 00:27:46.660
I hate this place.

00:27:49.530 --> 00:27:50.110
How's that?

00:27:51.080 --> 00:27:52.220
I hate this place.

00:27:56.580 --> 00:27:57.100
This place!

00:28:01.500 --> 00:28:02.280
I hate this place.

00:28:16.170 --> 00:28:16.890
Hello, Maurice.

00:28:18.500 --> 00:28:22.220
Holling, what's all this?

00:28:23.280 --> 00:28:24.240
I brought back your gifts.

00:28:26.380 --> 00:28:29.840
Those stock things from your broker are there on the desk.

00:28:31.820 --> 00:28:38.200
you're returning miranda's portfolio well i appreciate your generosity but i can't take them

00:28:39.980 --> 00:28:48.500
why not you've gone beyond the bounds of what i consider to be acceptable gift giving maurice

00:28:48.880 --> 00:28:57.510
well calling i'm a wealthy man i can afford a few frocks it's not the cost it's the thought behind

